{"message":"OK","data":{"content":"<h2><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#5c3ebc;\"><strong>Payment Methods</strong></span></h2><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#202124;\">General list of payment methods can be found under the payment-methods section.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#202124;\">PaymentMethod:1 in orders refers to MasterPass payment which is one of the online payments. However, you can't find it in payment-methods endpoints because you can't make any change for this payment type.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#202124;\">Since GetirFood users have the right to choose their method of payment, online payment methods cannot be queried with&nbsp;<strong>/payment-methods</strong> endpoint but rest of the other payment methods will.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#202124;\">List all of the payment methods</span></p><ul><li><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#202124;\"><strong>GET/payment-methods</strong></span></li></ul><p><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Get the restaurant payment methods</span></p><ul><li><strong>GET/restaurants/payment-methods</strong></li></ul><p><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Activate restaurant payment method</span></p><ul><li><strong>POST/restaurants/payment-methods/active</strong></li></ul><p><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Inactivate restaurant payment method</span></p><ul><li><strong>POST/restaurants/payment-methods/inactive</strong></li></ul><p><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Add restaurant payment method</span></p><ul><li><strong>POST/restaurants/payment-methods</strong></li></ul><p><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Delete restaurant payment method</span></p><ul><li><strong>DELETE/restaurants/payment-methods</strong></li></ul><figure class=\"table\" style=\"float:left;height:px;width:350px;\"><table><thead><tr><th style=\"background-color:#5D3EBC;width:200px;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"color:#FFD10D;\"><strong>Definition</strong></span></p></th><th style=\"background-color:#5D3EBC;width:50px;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"color:#FFD10D;\"><strong>Type</strong></span></p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>MasterPass</td><td style=\"text-align:right;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">1</p></td></tr><tr><td>BKM</td><td style=\"text-align:right;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">2</p></td></tr><tr><td>Credit / Debit Card</td><td style=\"text-align:right;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">3</p></td></tr><tr><td>Cash</td><td style=\"text-align:right;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">4</p></td></tr><tr><td>Multinet Card</td><td style=\"text-align:right;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">5</p></td></tr><tr><td>Sodexo Card</td><td style=\"text-align:right;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">6</p></td></tr><tr><td>Ticket Card</td><td style=\"text-align:right;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">8</p></td></tr><tr><td>Setcard Card</td><td style=\"text-align:right;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">10</p></td></tr><tr><td>Metropol Card</td><td style=\"text-align:right;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">11</p></td></tr><tr><td>Paye Card</td><td style=\"text-align:right;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">12</p></td></tr><tr><td>MobilExpress</td><td><p style=\"text-align:center;\">15</p></td></tr><tr><td>GetirMoney</td><td style=\"text-align:right;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">16</p></td></tr><tr><td>Sodexo Pass Mobile App</td><td style=\"text-align:right;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">17</p></td></tr><tr><td>CIO Card</td><td style=\"text-align:right;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">18</p></td></tr><tr><td>Sodexo Online</td><td style=\"text-align:right;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">19</p></td></tr><tr><td>TokenFlex</td><td style=\"text-align:right;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">21</p></td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>&nbsp;</p>"}}